	(text "HDPLX = 1 (half duplex)   FAST = 0 (slew limited, <= 250 kbit/s)   SHDN = 1\nDE has a pull-down: the RS-485 driver stays off until firmware enables it.\nThe RS-485 receiver is always on: firmware discards its own echo.\nIn RS-232 mode DE drives T2OUT on J4 pin 1 (unused - leave open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
